	(text "DO1/DO2 (F-10): two-stage NPN driver from 5V0, non-inverting, default OFF (base pulldown + QnB clamps gate; 10k gate pulldown retained).  SS3200 200V flyback to VIN (F-11).  DO1/DO2 inactive on battery backup (5V0 absent)."
